 ProcessTool_WithBigFont;globalParms;list;parms;n1;result
⍝ Presents a list of any length with a big font; allows processing selected rows via context menu
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 globalParms.(fontStandard fontInput)←2⍴⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Courier New')('Size' 22))
 list←∪300⍴#.⎕NL-3
 list←list[⍋⊃list]
 parms←##.APLGUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'Process selected items'
 parms.colTitles←,⊂'Numbers'
 parms.style←##.APLGUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi
 parms.info←'Select as many items as you like and then select "Process my items" from the context menu'
 parms.useWindowsRegistry←1
 parms.processBtnCaption←''
 parms.contextMenuCaptions←'Process my items'
⍝ parms.default←{(⍳⍵)∊3?⎕IO⊃⍵}⍴list
 n1←globalParms parms ##.APLGUI.ProcessTool.Create list'##.##.##.APLGUI.APLGUI_Demo.∆OnTestHandler_ProcessTool'

 result←##.APLGUI.ProcessTool.ModalWait n1
 ⎕←(⍕result),' item(s) were processed'
